column89:
The problem comes from this:<p><pre><code>    code {
        font-family: "Lucida Sans", Monaco, Bitstream Vera Sans Mono, Lucida Console, Terminal;
    }
</code></pre>
Which is simply a poorly made rule, regardless of browser and OS. If you dont have any of the specified fonts, your browser will use its general default font, which is usually either serif or sans-serif.
